Write a narration of exactly ' + targetWords + ' words. The narration MUST contain between ' + minWords + ' and ' + maxWords + ' words (inclusive). This is a strict requirement - the actual spoken narration word count will be verified and must fall in this range.

Count only the spoken narration text from all scene "narration" fields combined. Do NOT count title, description, hashtags, captions, or image prompts.

